{"chunk_id": "b242e64a4d36", "text": "As the search for Indrajita begins, Rama dispatches leading monkey warriors\u2014Hanuman, Angada, Nila and others\u2014to pursue the elusive prince. Indrajita, master of illusion, counters from concealment, loosing volleys of arrows that halt the monkeys\u2019 aerial advance. Invisible in the darkness, he unleashes a devastating storm of enchanted shafts upon Rama and Lakshmana. The brothers are trapped in a net of arrows, their bodies pierced everywhere until blood pours from their wounds and they resemble flowering kimshuka trees. Boasting that even the god Indra cannot face him when he fights unseen, Indrajita strikes them down. Rama falls first, Lakshmana collapses in despair, and the monkey army gathers around the unconscious heroes in grief, believing their champions lost.\nThe invisible Indrajita overwhelms Rama and Lakshmana with a storm of arrows, leaving them grievously wounded and unconscious as the monkeys despair.\nThemes: illusion in warfare, heroic suffering, despair of allies, power of Indrajita, turning point in battle", "vector": [-0.01276235282421112, -0.019633356481790543, -0.01468140259385109, 0.011058022268116474, 0.017392229288816452, 0.021029029041528702, -0.01794244535267353, -0.030490079894661903, -0.010581614449620247, -0.015486598946154118, 0.009689189493656158, 0.011339840479195118, 0.005579335615038872, -0.003452276811003685, 0.004636585712432861, 0.008501525036990643, 0.04348057135939598, -0.014090926386415958, 0.027484016492962837, -0.0034187270794063807, -0.007011913228780031, 0.004183663055300713, -0.0042541176080703735, -0.0065220859833061695, -0.01727144978940487, -0.003452276811003685, 0.02449137158691883, -0.036690086126327515, 0.0021488661877810955, -0.01233291532844305, -0.008488105610013008, -0.020103054121136665, -0.0002782538649626076, -0.001427544979378581, -0.035106536000967026, -0.005139832850545645, 0.009266461245715618, -0.010501095093786716, 0.011937027797102928, -0.00262862863019